   "he": "רַבִּי אֱלִיעֶזֶר אוֹמֵר: אִם הָיְתָה אׇרְכָּהּ כּוּ׳. וְהָתַנְיָא, רַבִּי אֱלִיעֶזֶר אוֹמֵר: אִם הָיְתָה אׇרְכָּהּ יָתֵר עַל פִּי שְׁנַיִם בְּרׇחְבָּהּ אֲפִילּוּ אַמָּה אַחַת — אֵין מְטַלְטְלִין בְּתוֹכָהּ!",
   "en": "We learned in the mishna that «Rabbi Eliezer says: If its length is» greater than its breadth, even by one cubit, one may not carry inside it. The Gemara asks: «Wasn’t it taught» in a baraita that «Rabbi Eliezer says: If its length is more than double its breadth, even by one cubit, one may not carry inside it?»"
  }
